     "<div><div>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;hbayesdm-users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hbayesdm-user...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nhbayesd...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/hbayesdm-users/5a0118f8-3561-40f9-8fca-9ec52cb6551f%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/hbayesdm-users/5a0118f8-3561-40f9-8fca-9ec52cb6551f%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243280359000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cGKFiqNdpG5rWQldvpykW\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/hbayesdm-users/5a0118f8-3561-40f9-8fca-9ec52cb6551f%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243280359000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NEsGQqqnSvX4g1FwAHvUT\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
